WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.920
Олья, привет, that means hello in Russian.

00:00:04.500 --> 00:00:05.560
Welcome to Privet,

00:00:06.260 --> 00:00:08.580
русский episode 7,

00:00:09.020 --> 00:00:11.740
for March 28, 2026.

00:00:12.420 --> 00:00:12.900
I'm Olya,

00:00:13.460 --> 00:00:17.300
and today we're going to learn some really fun Russian words.

00:00:17.940 --> 00:00:18.160
Ready?

00:00:18.800 --> 00:00:19.340
Поехали.

00:00:20.200 --> 00:00:21.700
That means let's go.

00:00:22.580 --> 00:00:23.000
Олья,

00:00:23.440 --> 00:00:25.400
our word of the day is pagoda.

00:00:26.080 --> 00:00:27.380
Олья, pagoda.

00:00:27.960 --> 00:00:29.300
Па, go, да.

00:00:29.820 --> 00:00:31.220
Олья, it means weather.

00:00:31.840 --> 00:00:34.180
Олья, repeat after me, pagoda.

00:00:34.800 --> 00:00:35.820
Олья, pagoda.

00:00:36.380 --> 00:00:38.680
Олья, it sounds like page plus ода.

00:00:39.400 --> 00:00:43.400
Олья, imagine turning the page of a weather calendar every single day.

00:00:44.020 --> 00:00:45.840
Олья, now let's use it in a sentence.

00:00:46.420 --> 00:00:47.220
Какая сегодня pagoda?

00:00:47.940 --> 00:00:50.240
Олья, that means what is the weather like today?

00:00:50.980 --> 00:00:52.080
Олья, great job.

00:00:52.440 --> 00:00:54.160
Now we will build more weather words together.

00:00:54.820 --> 00:00:55.080
Олья,

00:00:55.080 --> 00:00:56.200
First is dust,

00:00:56.500 --> 00:00:57.080
Олья,

00:00:57.500 --> 00:00:57.720
дожд,

00:00:58.280 --> 00:00:58.860
дождя,

00:00:58.920 --> 00:00:59.720
Олья,

00:01:00.080 --> 00:01:00.680
it means rain.

00:01:01.200 --> 00:01:01.700
Олья,

00:01:02.000 --> 00:01:02.740
repeat after me,

00:01:03.040 --> 00:01:03.300
дожд,

00:01:03.860 --> 00:01:04.200
Олья,

00:01:04.480 --> 00:01:04.720
дожд,

00:01:05.340 --> 00:01:05.680
Олья.

00:01:06.000 --> 00:01:06.700
It sounds like dodge,

00:01:06.920 --> 00:01:08.060
you have to dodge the raindrops.

00:01:08.640 --> 00:01:08.980
Олья,

00:01:09.300 --> 00:01:11.020
we can say it is still in a dожд.

00:01:11.660 --> 00:01:12.000
Олья,

00:01:12.200 --> 00:01:13.920
that means heavy rain is falling.

00:01:14.520 --> 00:01:14.780
Олья,

00:01:15.120 --> 00:01:15.940
next we have wetter.

00:01:16.540 --> 00:01:16.860
Олья,

00:01:17.180 --> 00:01:17.520
ветер,

00:01:18.000 --> 00:01:18.560
воетер,

00:01:19.000 --> 00:01:19.520
Олья,

00:01:19.820 --> 00:01:20.400
it means wind,

00:01:20.780 --> 00:01:21.000
Олья,

00:01:21.660 --> 00:01:22.540
repeat after me,

00:01:23.100 --> 00:01:23.420
ветер,

00:01:23.860 --> 00:01:24.140
Олья,

00:01:24.140 --> 00:01:24.880
ветер,

00:01:25.120 --> 00:01:25.660
Олья,

00:01:26.000 --> 00:01:26.560
think of veteran,

00:01:26.880 --> 00:01:28.800
an old wind that has been blowing for years.

00:01:29.220 --> 00:01:29.540
Олья,

00:01:29.760 --> 00:01:31.240
we say сегодня still in a witter.

00:01:31.880 --> 00:01:32.200
Олья,

00:01:32.500 --> 00:01:33.940
that means today there is strong wind.

00:01:34.440 --> 00:01:34.700
Олья,

00:01:34.960 --> 00:01:36.060
now let's learn солнце.

00:01:36.840 --> 00:01:37.160
Олья,

00:01:37.520 --> 00:01:37.980
солнце,

00:01:38.480 --> 00:01:39.060
солнце,

00:01:39.060 --> 00:01:39.300
солнце,

00:01:39.780 --> 00:01:40.380
Олья,

00:01:40.720 --> 00:01:41.260
it means sun.

00:01:41.860 --> 00:01:42.160
Олья,

00:01:42.480 --> 00:01:43.120
repeat after me,

00:01:43.480 --> 00:01:43.800
солнце,

00:01:44.320 --> 00:01:44.600
Олья,

00:01:45.420 --> 00:01:47.820
it sounds like soul plus NC,

00:01:48.320 --> 00:01:48.940
our sunny friend.

00:01:49.480 --> 00:01:49.800
Олья,

00:01:50.100 --> 00:01:50.560
we can say,

00:01:50.720 --> 00:01:51.700
солнце светит ярко.

00:01:52.320 --> 00:01:52.620
Олья,

00:01:52.620 --> 00:01:54.200
that means the sun is shining brightly.

00:01:54.660 --> 00:01:54.880
Олья,

00:01:55.100 --> 00:01:55.820
here is Oblaco.

00:01:56.160 --> 00:01:56.740
Олья,

00:01:56.940 --> 00:01:57.520
Oblaco,

00:01:57.960 --> 00:01:58.380
Oblaco.

00:01:58.700 --> 00:01:59.180
Олья,

00:01:59.380 --> 00:02:00.100
it means cloud.

00:02:00.740 --> 00:02:01.040
Олья,

00:02:01.400 --> 00:02:02.500
repeat after me,

00:02:02.980 --> 00:02:03.320
Oblaco.

00:02:03.880 --> 00:02:04.180
Олья,

00:02:04.500 --> 00:02:04.880
Oblaco.

00:02:05.460 --> 00:02:05.800
Олья,

00:02:06.000 --> 00:02:07.640
it sounds like oblong cloud.

00:02:08.160 --> 00:02:09.480
an oblong fluffy cloud.

00:02:09.920 --> 00:02:10.240
Олья,

00:02:10.560 --> 00:02:11.280
we say in a neighborhood

00:02:11.280 --> 00:02:12.480
большое белое Oblaco.

00:02:13.000 --> 00:02:13.360
Олья,

00:02:13.720 --> 00:02:16.060
that means there is a big white cloud in the sky.

00:02:16.680 --> 00:02:16.980
Олья,

00:02:17.320 --> 00:02:18.320
next is Groza.

00:02:18.980 --> 00:02:19.300
Олья,

00:02:19.760 --> 00:02:20.120
Groza,

00:02:22.260 --> 00:02:23.500
it means thunderstorm.

00:02:24.040 --> 00:02:24.500
Олья,

00:02:24.800 --> 00:02:25.680
repeat after me,

00:02:25.940 --> 00:02:26.420
Groza.

00:02:27.000 --> 00:02:27.340
Олья,

00:02:27.560 --> 00:02:28.020
Groza.

00:02:28.540 --> 00:02:28.860
Олья,

00:02:29.180 --> 00:02:30.280
it sounds like grows A.

00:02:30.640 --> 00:02:31.280
The storm grows

00:02:31.280 --> 00:02:32.500
with thunder and lightning.

00:02:32.980 --> 00:02:33.220
Олья,

00:02:33.540 --> 00:02:34.540
we can say in Cherabla,

00:02:34.640 --> 00:02:35.220
сильное гроза.

00:02:35.880 --> 00:02:36.140
Олья,

00:02:36.600 --> 00:02:37.300
that means yesterday

00:02:37.300 --> 00:02:38.620
there was a strong thunderstorm.

00:02:39.460 --> 00:02:39.700
Олья,

00:02:40.120 --> 00:02:41.180
now two easy feelings.

00:02:41.840 --> 00:02:42.480
First холодно.

00:02:43.140 --> 00:02:43.420
Олья,

00:02:44.020 --> 00:02:44.380
холодно.

00:02:44.960 --> 00:02:45.840
Кэй-хол-адна.

00:02:46.640 --> 00:02:46.920
Олья,

00:02:47.220 --> 00:02:48.180
it means it is cold.

00:02:48.180 --> 00:02:49.060
Олья,

00:02:49.220 --> 00:02:50.120
repeat after me,

00:02:50.300 --> 00:02:50.740
холодно.

00:02:51.120 --> 00:02:51.400
Олья,

00:02:51.580 --> 00:02:52.120
холодно.

00:02:52.540 --> 00:02:52.840
Олья,

00:02:53.060 --> 00:02:54.120
it sounds like cold

00:02:54.120 --> 00:02:55.520
with an H at the beginning.

00:02:55.960 --> 00:02:56.440
H cold.

00:02:56.800 --> 00:02:57.060
No,

00:02:57.620 --> 00:02:57.900
Олья,

00:02:58.200 --> 00:02:58.700
we say now

00:02:58.700 --> 00:02:59.480
it's a холодно.

00:02:59.900 --> 00:03:00.200
Олья,

00:03:00.440 --> 00:03:01.840
that means it is cold outside.

00:03:02.520 --> 00:03:02.820
Олья,

00:03:03.120 --> 00:03:04.060
and the opposite is

00:03:04.060 --> 00:03:04.360
Teplo.

00:03:04.960 --> 00:03:05.260
Олья,

00:03:05.620 --> 00:03:05.940
Teplo,

00:03:06.240 --> 00:03:06.460
Teplo,

00:03:06.460 --> 00:03:06.560
Teplo,

00:03:06.720 --> 00:03:06.880
Teplo,

00:03:07.240 --> 00:03:07.820
Олья,

00:03:12.760 --> 00:03:14.240
think of Teplo,

00:03:14.400 --> 00:03:16.020
Teplo is slightly warm.

00:03:16.020 --> 00:03:16.760
Олья,

00:03:17.120 --> 00:03:17.680
we simply say

00:03:17.680 --> 00:03:18.420
Sigodnya Teplo.

00:03:18.880 --> 00:03:19.220
Олья,

00:03:19.440 --> 00:03:20.820
that means today it is warm.

00:03:21.200 --> 00:03:21.520
Олья,

00:03:21.840 --> 00:03:22.320
we also have

00:03:22.320 --> 00:03:22.640
Bura.

00:03:23.060 --> 00:03:23.400
Олья,

00:03:23.620 --> 00:03:23.940
Bura.

00:03:24.780 --> 00:03:25.020
Олья,

00:03:25.880 --> 00:03:26.640
it means storm.

00:03:27.060 --> 00:03:27.340
Олья,

00:03:27.680 --> 00:03:28.520
repeat after me.

00:03:29.100 --> 00:03:29.280
Bura.

00:03:29.720 --> 00:03:30.040
Олья,

00:03:31.800 --> 00:03:32.220
it sounds like

00:03:32.220 --> 00:03:33.460
a rude wild storm

00:03:33.460 --> 00:03:34.340
that bursts in.

00:03:34.860 --> 00:03:35.180
Олья,

00:03:35.500 --> 00:03:35.780
we say

00:03:35.780 --> 00:03:36.780
it's a Bura.

00:03:37.260 --> 00:03:37.580
Олья,

00:03:37.880 --> 00:03:39.120
that means a storm is approaching.

00:03:39.700 --> 00:03:40.020
Олья,

00:03:40.360 --> 00:03:41.400
and our last new word is

00:03:41.400 --> 00:03:41.740
Raduga.

00:03:42.280 --> 00:03:42.600
Олья,

00:03:42.860 --> 00:03:43.180
Raduga,

00:03:43.180 --> 00:03:44.200
Oraduga.

00:03:44.700 --> 00:03:45.340
Олья,

00:03:45.660 --> 00:03:46.400
it means rainbow.

00:03:46.880 --> 00:03:47.200
Олья,

00:03:47.580 --> 00:03:48.600
repeat after me.

00:03:48.960 --> 00:03:49.260
Raduga.

00:03:49.640 --> 00:03:50.140
Олья,

00:03:50.380 --> 00:03:50.780
Raduga.

00:03:51.260 --> 00:03:51.600
Олья,

00:03:51.920 --> 00:03:52.120
Ra,

00:03:52.280 --> 00:03:53.180
like ray of light plus

00:03:53.180 --> 00:03:53.520
Duga,

00:03:53.760 --> 00:03:54.180
like arc.

00:03:54.640 --> 00:03:55.920
A colorful arc of rays.

00:03:56.500 --> 00:03:56.860
Олья,

00:03:57.180 --> 00:03:57.520
we say

00:03:57.520 --> 00:03:59.020
после дождя появилась

00:03:59.020 --> 00:03:59.600
Raduga.

00:04:00.260 --> 00:04:00.580
Олья,

00:04:00.920 --> 00:04:01.220
that means

00:04:01.220 --> 00:04:01.900
after the rain,

00:04:02.120 --> 00:04:02.960
a rainbow appeared.

00:04:03.520 --> 00:04:03.840
Олья,

00:04:04.520 --> 00:04:06.160
now for our grammar bite.

00:04:06.740 --> 00:04:07.100
Олья,

00:04:07.520 --> 00:04:08.680
we use the question word

00:04:08.680 --> 00:04:09.480
Kakoy,

00:04:09.740 --> 00:04:10.140
Kakaya,

00:04:10.140 --> 00:04:10.880
or Kakoya.

00:04:11.440 --> 00:04:11.920
Олья,

00:04:12.280 --> 00:04:12.760
it means

00:04:12.760 --> 00:04:13.960
what kind of

00:04:13.960 --> 00:04:15.480
or how is it?

00:04:15.760 --> 00:04:16.080
Олья,

00:04:16.440 --> 00:04:17.220
the ending changes

00:04:17.220 --> 00:04:18.340
depending on the noun.

00:04:18.860 --> 00:04:19.240
Олья,

00:04:19.620 --> 00:04:20.700
with pagoda we use

00:04:20.700 --> 00:04:21.880
feminine Kakaya.

00:04:22.480 --> 00:04:22.880
Олья,

00:04:23.160 --> 00:04:24.160
so we ask Kakaya

00:04:24.160 --> 00:04:25.100
сегодня pagoda.

00:04:25.700 --> 00:04:26.080
Олья,

00:04:26.340 --> 00:04:26.760
that means

00:04:26.760 --> 00:04:28.220
what is the weather like today?

00:04:29.200 --> 00:04:29.600
Олья,

00:04:30.020 --> 00:04:31.200
in English we say

00:04:31.200 --> 00:04:32.440
what is the weather like?

00:04:33.220 --> 00:04:33.580
Олья,

00:04:34.020 --> 00:04:35.300
in Russian we ask

00:04:35.300 --> 00:04:36.860
what kind of weather is it?

00:04:37.540 --> 00:04:37.920
Олья,

00:04:38.280 --> 00:04:39.060
it is like asking

00:04:39.060 --> 00:04:39.900
for a description.

00:04:40.740 --> 00:04:41.060
Олья,

00:04:41.400 --> 00:04:42.180
now let's try

00:04:42.180 --> 00:04:43.020
with other words.

00:04:43.500 --> 00:04:43.980
Олья,

00:04:44.180 --> 00:04:44.360
Kakoy,

00:04:44.440 --> 00:04:45.120
сегодня ветер.

00:04:45.880 --> 00:04:46.240
Олья,

00:04:46.740 --> 00:04:47.220
that means,

00:04:47.420 --> 00:04:48.520
what is the wind like today?

00:04:49.460 --> 00:04:49.840
Олья,

00:04:50.340 --> 00:04:50.840
in Kakoy,

00:04:50.960 --> 00:04:51.580
сегодня неба?

00:04:52.360 --> 00:04:52.780
Олья,

00:04:53.180 --> 00:04:53.520
that means,

00:04:53.720 --> 00:04:54.960
what is the sky like today?

00:04:55.920 --> 00:04:56.360
Олья,

00:04:56.720 --> 00:04:57.800
Russians love talking

00:04:57.800 --> 00:04:58.520
about the weather

00:04:58.520 --> 00:04:59.740
almost as much as

00:04:59.740 --> 00:05:00.560
British people do.

00:05:01.160 --> 00:05:01.700
Олья,

00:05:02.420 --> 00:05:02.920
in winter,

00:05:03.180 --> 00:05:03.960
they often say

00:05:03.960 --> 00:05:04.960
Moro's isoncer.

00:05:05.540 --> 00:05:06.180
Den to destiny.

00:05:07.300 --> 00:05:07.660
Олья,

00:05:07.660 --> 00:05:09.020
that is a famous line

00:05:09.020 --> 00:05:10.400
from Alexander Pushkin.

00:05:11.300 --> 00:05:11.560
Олья,

00:05:11.940 --> 00:05:12.340
it means,

00:05:12.640 --> 00:05:13.420
frost and sun,

00:05:13.680 --> 00:05:14.500
a wonderful day.

00:05:15.520 --> 00:05:15.900
Олья,

00:05:16.400 --> 00:05:17.700
even when it is very cold,

00:05:17.820 --> 00:05:18.740
many Russians still go

00:05:18.740 --> 00:05:19.360
for a walk.

00:05:20.140 --> 00:05:20.460
Олья,

00:05:20.980 --> 00:05:21.860
they say fresh air

00:05:21.860 --> 00:05:22.620
is very healthy.

00:05:23.440 --> 00:05:23.780
Олья,

00:05:24.260 --> 00:05:25.900
now it is practice time.

00:05:26.420 --> 00:05:26.740
Олья,

00:05:27.240 --> 00:05:28.020
do you remember

00:05:28.020 --> 00:05:28.900
what pagoda means?

00:05:29.760 --> 00:05:30.100
Олья,

00:05:30.520 --> 00:05:30.720
yes,

00:05:31.400 --> 00:05:32.080
it means weather.

00:05:32.700 --> 00:05:33.060
Олья,

00:05:33.400 --> 00:05:34.100
what about dust?

00:05:34.800 --> 00:05:35.160
Олья,

00:05:35.540 --> 00:05:36.160
it means rain.

00:05:36.160 --> 00:05:37.180
Олья,

00:05:37.500 --> 00:05:38.680
try to say today's words

00:05:38.680 --> 00:05:40.040
out loud three times.

00:05:40.540 --> 00:05:41.080
Олья,

00:05:41.360 --> 00:05:42.320
for kids draw a big

00:05:42.320 --> 00:05:42.920
weather picture

00:05:42.920 --> 00:05:43.380
with sun,

00:05:43.620 --> 00:05:44.160
dust,

00:05:44.720 --> 00:05:45.040
radoga,

00:05:45.420 --> 00:05:45.820
and obloka.

00:05:46.500 --> 00:05:46.840
Олья,

00:05:47.280 --> 00:05:48.860
label each thing in Russian.

00:05:49.620 --> 00:05:50.040
Олья,

00:05:50.580 --> 00:05:51.100
then play

00:05:51.100 --> 00:05:52.020
what is the weather

00:05:52.020 --> 00:05:52.900
with your family.

00:05:53.920 --> 00:05:54.320
Олья,

00:05:54.800 --> 00:05:56.060
one person says

00:05:56.060 --> 00:05:57.080
сегодня холодно

00:05:57.080 --> 00:05:58.020
идёт дождь

00:05:58.020 --> 00:05:59.120
and everyone acts it out.

00:05:59.840 --> 00:06:00.220
Олья,

00:06:00.800 --> 00:06:01.800
now here is something

00:06:01.800 --> 00:06:02.400
really cool

00:06:02.400 --> 00:06:03.800
about one of today's words.

00:06:04.360 --> 00:06:04.900
Олья,

00:06:04.900 --> 00:06:06.920
want to know a secret

00:06:06.920 --> 00:06:07.840
about pagoda?

00:06:08.620 --> 00:06:09.000
Олья,

00:06:09.360 --> 00:06:10.880
the Russian word

00:06:10.880 --> 00:06:10.980
pagoda

00:06:11.440 --> 00:06:12.420
and the English word

00:06:12.420 --> 00:06:13.520
weather are actually

00:06:13.520 --> 00:06:14.480
distant cousins.

00:06:15.300 --> 00:06:15.720
Олья,

00:06:16.520 --> 00:06:17.340
they both come

00:06:17.340 --> 00:06:18.340
from an ancient route

00:06:18.340 --> 00:06:19.060
that means

00:06:19.060 --> 00:06:19.600
to blow

00:06:19.600 --> 00:06:20.860
or to weather.

00:06:21.740 --> 00:06:22.180
Олья,

00:06:22.640 --> 00:06:23.420
this route

00:06:23.420 --> 00:06:23.880
became

00:06:23.880 --> 00:06:24.720
weather in English

00:06:24.720 --> 00:06:25.400
and pagoda

00:06:25.400 --> 00:06:25.980
in Russian.

00:06:26.720 --> 00:06:27.060
Олья,

00:06:27.500 --> 00:06:28.380
in old Russian,

00:06:28.680 --> 00:06:29.040
pagoda,

00:06:29.600 --> 00:06:30.360
originally meant

00:06:30.360 --> 00:06:31.380
good weather only.

00:06:32.160 --> 00:06:32.520
Олья,

00:06:32.520 --> 00:06:34.080
so when Russians say

00:06:34.080 --> 00:06:35.200
хорошее pagoda,

00:06:35.360 --> 00:06:36.520
they are kind of saying

00:06:36.520 --> 00:06:38.040
good weather.

00:06:38.620 --> 00:06:39.180
Олья,

00:06:39.460 --> 00:06:40.660
next time you check

00:06:40.660 --> 00:06:41.460
the weather forecast,

00:06:41.680 --> 00:06:42.280
remember they are

00:06:42.280 --> 00:06:42.640
cousins.

00:06:43.240 --> 00:06:43.880
Олья,

00:06:44.260 --> 00:06:45.160
they both come

00:06:45.160 --> 00:06:46.260
from the idea of how

00:06:46.260 --> 00:06:47.020
the wind blows.

00:06:48.020 --> 00:06:48.480
Олья,

00:06:49.500 --> 00:06:50.140
Молодец,

00:06:50.420 --> 00:06:51.620
that means

00:06:51.620 --> 00:06:52.600
well done.

00:06:53.260 --> 00:06:54.480
Remember every expert

00:06:54.480 --> 00:06:55.660
started as a beginner.

00:06:56.300 --> 00:06:56.920
Practice saying

00:06:56.920 --> 00:06:57.640
today's words

00:06:57.640 --> 00:06:58.260
out loud

00:06:58.260 --> 00:06:59.460
even just once

00:06:59.460 --> 00:07:01.020
and you'll be amazed

00:07:01.020 --> 00:07:02.160
how fast you learn.

00:07:02.160 --> 00:07:03.740
See you next time.

